{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/RevenueCat\/documentation\/RevenueCat\/AppleReceipt\/InAppPurchase\/purchaseDate"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/revenuecat\/applereceipt\/inapppurchase\/purchasedate"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10RevenueCat12AppleReceiptV13InAppPurchaseV12purchaseDate10Foundation0I0Vvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","title":"purchaseDate","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"purchaseDate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","text":"Date"}],"modules":[{"name":"RevenueCat"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RevenueCat\/documentation\/RevenueCat","doc:\/\/RevenueCat\/documentation\/RevenueCat\/AppleReceipt","doc:\/\/RevenueCat\/documentation\/RevenueCat\/AppleReceipt\/InAppPurchase"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The date and time that the item was purchased."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"purchaseDate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst","macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This value corresponds to the transaction’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transactionDate"},{"type":"text","text":" property."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For a transaction that restores a previous transaction, the purchase date is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same as the original purchase date."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"t